&gt; Tough one. A major coastal city. Is so appealing, but the recent tech boom has honestly changed the city for the worse and the costs in the city have made it quite unaffordable and crowded. Your budget would not work as well in the city as it might in other parts of the region as suggested, such as a specific affluent suburb or another nearby town.
